    3,600\\n\uC218\uC2EC(m): 11~14\",\"cranes\":\"\uC9D1 \uD06C\uB808\uC778 30~50t\\n\uC8FC\uD589\uC2DD
    \uD0C0\uC6CC\uD06C\uB808\uC778 60t\",\"equipment\":null,\"notes\":\"\xB7 2023\uB144
    \uBCF4\uB3C4\uC5D0 \uC548\uBCBD \uC5F0\uC7A5 \uACF5\uC0AC \uACC4\uD68D\uC774
    \uC5B8\uAE09\uB428.\",\"confidence\":\"A\",\"source\":\"\uD55C\uD654\uC624\uC158
    \uACF5\uC2DD \uD648\uD398\uC774\uC9C0 > \uAC70\uC81C\uC0AC\uC5C5\uC7A5 \uC18C\uAC1C
    > Facilities\\nHanwha Ocean official site > Geoje shipyard > Facilities (English)\\nLloyd's
    Register New Construction Guide - Hanwha Ocean Co Ltd (2026-06-08 \uAC31\uC2E0)\\n\uD55C\uD654\uC624\uC158
    \uACF5\uC2DD \uD648\uD398\uC774\uC9C0 > \uAC70\uC81C\uC0AC\uC5C5\uC7A5 \uC18C\uAC1C
    > Build a Ship\\n\uD30C\uC774\uB0B8\uC15C\uB274\uC2A4 - \uAC70\uC81C \uC0AC\uC5C5\uC7A5
    \uACE8\uB9AC\uC557 \uD06C\uB808\uC778 CI \uAD50\uCCB4 (2023.08.27)\",\"imageFile\":\"09_outfitting_quay.png\",\"dimensionBasis\":\"WORKBOOK_PUBLIC_DATA\",\"locationBasis\":\"CURRENT_LAYOUT_RECONSTRUCTION\",\"lengthM\":null,\"widthM\":null,\"depthM\":null,\"areaM2\":null,\"quayLengthM\":3600.0,\"function_value_status\":null,\"function_source\":null,\"dimension_value_status\":null,\"dimension_status_note\":null,\"function_capabilities\":null,\"value_evidence\":[{\"key\":\"total_quay_length\",\"label\":\"TOTAL
    QUAY LENGTH\",\"value\":\"3600\",\"unit\":\"m\",\"value_status\":\"OFFICIAL\",\"source\":\"https://www.hanwhaocean.com/en/whoweare/ig/facilities/\",\"verified_date\":\"2026-10-20\",\"note\":null,\"status_detail\":null},{\"key\":\"water_depth\",\"label\":\"WATER
    DEPTH\",\"value\":\"11\u201314\",\"unit\":\"m\",\"value_status\":\"OFFICIAL\",\"source\":\"https://www.hanwhaocean.com/en/whoweare/ig/facilities/\",\"verified_date\":\"2026-10-20\",\"note\":null,\"status_detail\":null},{\"key\":\"segment_breakdown\",\"label\":\"3D
