    > Build a Plant\",\"imageFile\":\"21_outdoor_assembly.png\",\"dimensionBasis\":\"UNKNOWN\",\"locationBasis\":\"CURRENT_LAYOUT_RECONSTRUCTION\",\"lengthM\":null,\"widthM\":null,\"depthM\":null,\"areaM2\":null,\"quayLengthM\":null}"
